### Procar Backend API Calls

### Register new user - gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}



### Register User (Auth Service)
# Creates authentication credentials for the user
POST http://localhost:8082/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "admin-user-id",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### Create User Profile (User Service)
# Creates the user profile with roles - should be called after auth registration
POST http://localhost:8084/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "roles": ["ADMIN"]
}

###

### Login (Auth Service)
# Test login with created credentials
POST http://localhost:8082/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### Get All Users (User Service)
# Verify user profile was created
GET http://localhost:8084/api/admin/users

###

### Get Current User (User Service)
# Get current user info (requires auth token)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Validate Token (Auth Service)
# Validate access token
GET http://localhost:8082/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###
